Subject: [DRAFT] SYCL FA TILE: opt into grf_size_automatic

Why: upstream TILE D 128/256 spills at SIMD32 with 128 GRF on Intel Arc
A770 (Xe-HPG, acm-g10). Let IGC choose the register file size through
launch_fattn's existing use_large_grf template parameter in all six TILE
launch sites. Kernel arithmetic and sub-group size remain unchanged.
Against llama.cpp 79e2e74eb11022c1ba2e438df7f0ca2d4c10f8b6; VEC unchanged.
static evidence only; runtime effect unmeasured

